RideWorks commands
==================

Open the local RideWorks app (starts it if needed and opens the browser):
  ./start-rideworks

Run the app directly without opening a browser:
  .venv/bin/python -m rideworks serve

Show available RideWorks CLI commands:
  .venv/bin/python -m rideworks --help

Run the Python test suite:
  .venv/bin/python -m pytest -q

The launcher and commands above use the project-root .venv. `workon rideworks`
also activates the project's `venv` environment through the workon helper.
